      <Textbox Name="Textbox424">
        <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
        <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
        <Paragraphs>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>If now or in future, any of the information provided above is found not to be accordance with the facts, </Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>the company reserves the right to cancel this application/terminate the employment relationship/take legal action against the applicant in accordance with applicable laws.</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>Apabila sekarang maupun dikemudian hari, keterangan yang diberikan di atas ini ada yang tidak sesuai dengan kenyataan, perusahaan berhak membatalkan lamaran ini/memutuskan hubungan kerja/menuntut pelamar sesuai dengan hukum yang berlaku.</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Italic</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>8pt</FontSize>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Center</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
        </Paragraphs>
        <rd:DefaultName>Textbox2</rd:DefaultName>
        <Top>51.0369in</Top>
        <Left>0.12415in</Left>
        <Height>0.94273in</Height>
        <Width>7.40625in</Width>
        <ZIndex>427</ZIndex>
        <Style>
          <Border>
            <Style>None</Style>
          </Border>
          <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
          <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
          <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
          <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
        </Style>
      </Textbox>
      <Textbox Name="Textbox430">
        <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
        <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
        <Paragraphs>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>Jakarta, </Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>=Format(Fields!time_stamp.Value, "dd MMM yyyy")</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                  <Format>d MMMM, yyyy</Format>
                </Style>
              </TextRun>
            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
